<section class="page-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Our Story</p>
  <h1 class="display display--italic">Oorvi — Sanskrit<br>for Earth.</h1>
  <p class="page-hero__sub">
    In a world of processed food, Oorvi is a way back to our roots — one
    honestly pressed bottle at a time, from the heart of Hyderabad.
  </p>
</section>

<div class="story-block reveal">
  <div class="story-block__label">
    <p class="eyebrow">Where It Started</p>
    <h2 class="display display--sm">A return to how<br>oil used to be made.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="story-block__copy">
    <p class="body-lg">
      Most oil on a supermarket shelf has been through more processing than
      pressing — refined, bleached, deodorised and blended until very little
      of the original seed remains. Oorvi started as a rejection of that
      shortcut: a decision to press oil the way it was pressed before
      "refined" became the default.
    </p>
    <p class="body-lg">
      That meant going back to single-pressing — the first and only pass a
      seed goes through, with nothing added afterward to correct colour,
      smell, or shelf life. It's a slower, lower-yield way to make oil. It's
      also the only way we were willing to make it.
    </p>
    <div class="story-block__figure">
      <img src="{{ 'lifestyle-giftset.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Oorvi cold-pressed oils, traditionally presented" loading="lazy">
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="story-block reveal">
  <div class="story-block__label">
    <p class="eyebrow">How We Press</p>
    <h2 class="display display--sm">Native seed,<br>low heat, no shortcuts.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="story-block__copy">
    <p class="body-lg">
      We source A1-grade native variety seed directly from farms we trust,
      working with growers who follow chemical-free, sustainable practices.
      Cold-pressed lines run through steel expellers kept at low temperature;
      our wood-pressed line runs through a traditional stone-and-wood
      ghani, turning slowly so the seed is never rushed.
    </p>
    <ul class="promise-list">
      <li>No refining, bleaching, or deodorising — ever</li>
      <li>No blending with cheaper oils to stretch a batch</li>
      <li>Naturally settled instead of chemically filtered</li>
      <li>Bottled close to the press, not shipped in bulk and rebottled later</li>
      <li>Every batch traceable to its certification — FSSAI 23624028002885</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="story-block__figure">
      <img src="{{ 'lifestyle-kitchen.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Oorvi Mustard Oil in a traditional Indian kitchen" loading="lazy">
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

