</section>

<section class="sourcing reveal">
  <div class="sourcing__panel">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Born in Hyderabad</p>
    <h2 class="display display--italic">More than a brand —<br>a way back to nature.</h2>
    <p class="body-lg">
      Oorvi is a movement to bring back the lost connection between people
      and nature, one honestly pressed drop at a time. Every bottle carries
      the same promise the name does: nothing added, nothing taken away.
    </p>
    <a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url | default: routes.collections_url }}" class="btn btn--gold">Shop the range</a>
  </div>
</section>

